<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">The signed condition sign-off provides a clear record of the vehicle's condition at the time of delivery and helps to prevent any disputes or claims that may arise later.</p>
